    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d475">

                <pb facs="0499" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg327"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.85/150</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Uruguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jeffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-14T12:00:00-03:44">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 14, 1917, 12 noon</hi></date>. <lb/>
                            [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 6 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Police authorities of port of Montevideo to-day have placed all German ships
                    under police control. Rumors of possible injury to ships is the reason assigned
                    for this action. Germans have been taken off ships.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jeffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
